      "n": 50,
      "id": "HRE03-T280-GAREK",
      "scene": "Point of Interest.Point of Interest Enter Andorhal Start Q",
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "森林地区的敌人已经肃清了。现在该消灭剩下的围城敌人了。",
